<title>AUSTRIA: Austria April c/a deficit narrows to 3.4 bln ATS.</title>
<headline>Austria April c/a deficit narrows to 3.4 bln ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank reported the following economic indicator detail on Thursday.</p>
<p>AUSTRIAN CURRENT ACCOUNT</p>
<p> (in billions of schillings)     April   March   April '96</p>
<p> Current account balance	    -3.4    -5.2	-12.7</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance	  -4.2    -9.6	-11.7</p>
<p> Exports				  78.2    59.5	 63.8</p>
<p> Imports				  82.4    69.1	 75.5</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE FIGURES (January to month in question)</p>
<p> Current account balance	   -11.4    -8.0	 -4.6</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance	 -29.1   -24.8	-26.4</p>
<p> Exports				 259.4   181.2	245.0</p>
<p> Imports				 288.5   206.1	271.5</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
